{"event_type":"competition","id":28637,"name":"2026 Women's Runback Brewing Club Championship FALL Qualifier | Zone 1-2-3 (Restricted)","starts_on":"Oct 16, 2026","ends_on":"Oct 18, 2026","state":"pending","summary":"Location: Ottawa Hunt Club","description":"**Restricted Zone Qualifier to advance one team per qualifier. Random seeded double knockout draw.**\r\n\r\n- All team members must also register once per season as a participant of Curling Ontario at https://on.curling.io/en/products/10513-curling-ontario-participant-registration-2026-2027\r\n- Please see the eligibility rules to ensure your team is eligible to play in this event: https://www.curling.ca/events/competitor-information/competitor-eligibility/\r\n- Additional eligibility requirements may apply - see Competitor Guide posted at https://curlingontario.ca/competitions/competition-regulations/ for details. \r\n- Registration in this competition also requires payment of a Curling Canada High Performance Fee of $40 per team and an Ontario High Performance Fee of $20 per team. **This fee will be automatically added on at check out, but is not reflected in the total below.** HST is not charged on high performance fees.\r\n\r\n**Runback Brewing Club Championships Qualifying Options for 2026**\r\n\r\nTeams have a choice between two qualifying windows for the Runback Brewing Club Championships:\r\n\r\n- Spring Qualifying was held April 10–12 with 6 Zone Qualifiers (1 team advanced from each)\r\n- Fall Qualifying will be held October 16–18 with 6 Zone Qualifiers (1 team advances from each)\r\n\r\n**Key Registration Details:**\r\n\r\n- Teams must choose one qualifying event or the other, but cannot enter both qualifier weekends.\r\n- Your club can still enter up to two teams per gender **TOTAL** combined between Spring and Fall Qualifying. \r\n- Teams from the same club do not have to attend the same qualifier weekend.\r\n\r\nCommunications will be sent to all participants for which a valid email address is provided. Please have this information ready when completing your team registration.\r\n\r\n**Withdrawals and Refunds**\r\n\r\n- Should a team enter a Curling Ontario qualifier and choose to withdraw from an event prior to the entry deadline they will receive a refund, less 10% to cover processing fees.\r\n- To mitigate the disruption caused by last-minute alterations, Teams who choose to change qualifiers forfeit their original entry fee and must pay another full entry fee to register for the new qualifier of their choice.\r\n- Teams cannot change qualifiers after the entry deadline. There are no refunds for teams who withdraw after the entry deadline. \r\n- To change your qualifier you must register for the new one you’d like to participate in BY THE REGISTRATION DEADLINE and email competitions@curlingontario.ca to request to be removed from the one you no longer wish to participate in.\r\n- If a team withdraws after the draw schedule has been released that team’s games will be replaced with byes.\r\n\r\n**New to competition, or looking for a refresher?**\r\n\r\n- Read: Rules Ready, Game On! A Guide to Provincial Qualifying and Championship Play Click to get the guide: https://docs.google.com/document/d/16OMET7c0sfa6i3zzLcPuL6X536Bdolwb99BOv4uu-8E/edit?usp=sharing","team_restriction":"Womens","age_range":"N/A","sponsor":{"url":"https://on.curling.io/en/sponsors/527","logo_url":"https://curlingio.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/sponsor/logo/527/card_runback_brewing.png","name":"Runback Brewing"},"no_registration_message":"Registration closed","teams":[{"id":125893,"name":"Amphlett","short_name":"Amphlett","affiliation":"Granite Curling of West Ottawa","lineup":[{"curler_id":132909,"position":"fourth","skip":true,"name":"Jane Amphlett","club_name":"Granite Curling Club of West Ottawa","waiver":true,"gender":"female"},{"curler_id":28507,"position":"third","name":"Brigette Van Aert","waiver":true,"gender":"female"},{"curler_id":61729,"position":"second","name":"Hannah Keating",